<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal producer prices rise 4.0 pct yr/yr in Jan.</title>
<headline>Portugal producer prices rise 4.0 pct yr/yr in Jan.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's index of producer prices rose 4.0 percent year-on-year in January, while month-on-month it edged up 0.5 percent, the National Statistics Institute (INE) said.</p>
<p>					 Jan 97	Dec 96	Jan 96</p>
<p>General Index			122.1	  121.5	 117.5</p>
<p>Percentage change yr/yr	  +4.0	   +3.2	    --</p>
<p>Percentage change mo/mo	  +0.5	   +0.1	    --</p>
<p>Accumulated 12 months	    +3.3	   +3.1	    --</p>
<p>Base Year = 1985</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
</text>
